WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Next guest tonight
is a talented actress

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:03.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know from shows
such as "8 Simple Rules"

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:04.471 line:92%
and "The Big Bang Theory."

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:06.639 align:start size:94% position:6%
She both stars in
and executive-produces

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:08.508 align:start size:94% position:6%
the limited series
"The Flight Attendant,"

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:11.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
which premiers on HBO Max
on November 26th.

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:13.279 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let's take a look.
-Where are you?

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:15.448 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Uh, uh, I don't --

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:17.117 line:92%
This -- This place is so pretty.

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:19.619 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah?
No, okay, that's not an answer

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:22.288 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Let's see.

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:22.689 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Bangkok.

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:25.425
Oh, speaking of getting arrested
in foreign countries,

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:27.193 line:92%
do not get arrested there.

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:30.530 line:92%
The laws are, like, Byzantine.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:33.066 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Right. Uh, yeah.

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:34.100 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
How did you --

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:35.602 align:start size:94% position:6%
How did you know
that I'm in Bangkok?

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:38.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, when we took that girls
trip to Tuolumne,

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:41.107
and we turned on side something,
'cause, like, kidnapping.

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:44.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, um, yeah, you just neve
turned yours off, so...

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:46.379 line:92%
Listen, you're not, like,

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:48.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
actually in trouble
or something, are you?

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:52.819 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-No, I'm, uh...

00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:54.587 size:81% position:41% line:92%
hung over in Thailand.

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:57.457
-Please welcome back to the show
Kaley Cuoco.

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:58.792 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Hi, Kaley!

00:00:58.792 --> 00:01:01.161 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Hey, Seth! [ Chuckles ]

00:01:01.161 --> 00:01:03.296 line:92%
-It's so nice to see you.

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:05.432 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm really excited
about this show.

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:07.133 align:start size:94% position:6%
I watched the first episode.
It's great.

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:08.435 line:92%
But I do -- I want to ask --

00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:10.503
I know you've been spendin
a lot of time quarantining

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:12.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
How has life in isolation
been for you?

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:14.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know what?
I think, like everybody else

00:01:14.874 --> 00:01:19.512 align:start size:94% position:6%
mine is surrounded by a lot of
dogs and a lot of alcohol.

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:20.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
So it's been okay.
-Uh-huh.

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:23.450 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know? But, yeah, we'r
just hanging in there.

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:25.885 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel like I've quarantined
multiple times.

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:28.021 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've been in multiple places
over the past few months.

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:31.091
And I've really given my all
in quarantine, let me tell you

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:33.593 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've been committed.
-Well, society --

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:36.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
On behalf of society,
I thank you for doing that

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:39.432 align:start size:94% position:6%
You mentioned dogs.
You adopted a dog recently

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:43.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
Dumpy.
Here's Dumpy for everybody

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:45.705 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah. [ Laughs ]

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:47.407 size:84% position:42% line:92%
That is Sir Dump Truck.

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:50.743 align:start size:94% position:6%
I got him over the first
quarantine, many months ago.

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:54.914
He was supposed to be a foster
and I turned into a foster fail.

00:01:54.914 --> 00:01:57.250 align:start size:94% position:6%
I turned into a girl
with a dog in a stroller,

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:59.619 align:start size:94% position:6%
which I really didn't want
to become.

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:01.821 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And it should be noted,
the stroller

00:02:01.821 --> 00:02:05.258 size:81% position:41%
is not just stationary
as it is in the photo.

00:02:05.258 --> 00:02:07.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here's a quick video of Dump
doing his thing

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:09.295 size:78% position:39% line:92%
in a moving stroller.

00:02:09.295 --> 00:02:10.130 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No.
[ Dumpy barks ]

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:14.267 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh. You're really ferociou
in this stroller.

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:16.002 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughs ]

00:02:16.002 --> 00:02:18.905 line:92%
That dog could kick your ass

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:21.341 line:92%
-So, Kaley, tell us how...

00:02:21.341 --> 00:02:22.408 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, obviously,
you mentioned

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:24.844
you didn't want to turn into
that girl, and now here you are.

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:27.847
Do you notice -- Do you watch it
happening in real time,

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:30.183 size:78% position:39%
as you slowly realize
"I am now a person

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:31.451 line:92%
who has a dog in a stroller?

00:02:31.451 --> 00:02:32.452 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I didn't want
to be that person.

00:02:32.452 --> 00:02:35.755
You know, we have multiple dogs,
none of which have strollers

00:02:35.755 --> 00:02:38.491 size:81% position:41%
But I was in New York
for so long, shooting.

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:40.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Dumpy was there,
and he's older,

00:02:40.293 --> 00:02:44.063
so I thought it would be easie
to get out and get around --

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:44.831 line:92%
right? -- in the stroller.

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:47.000 size:84% position:42%
And the funny part is,
he's a very scared dog.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
He had a very traumatic life
before me.

00:02:48.468 --> 00:02:53.173 align:start size:94% position:6%
In the stroller, he has
this bravery and self-assuranc

00:02:53.173 --> 00:02:55.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I've never --
As you can see, he barks.

00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:57.911
He becomes completely aggressive
in the stroller.

00:02:57.911 --> 00:03:00.680 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know
what comes over in his brain

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:02.448 line:92%
-Uh, well, you know what?

00:03:02.448 --> 00:03:04.250 align:start size:94% position:6%
We gotta let Dumpy
live his best life.

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:06.853 align:start size:94% position:6%
He has some paparazzi,
as well, yes?

00:03:06.853 --> 00:03:09.255 align:start size:94% position:6%
People are excited to see Dump
on the streets.

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:10.456 line:92%
-Oh, my God. I'm telling you

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:12.292 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, we were in --
I was living in Tribeca,

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:14.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is a very -- you know,
it's pretty bougie.

00:03:14.494 --> 00:03:16.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
And there are a lot celebs
around and papar--

00:03:16.829 --> 00:03:20.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
not -- just a lot of paparazzi
And I realized,

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
every time I'd come down
early in the morning

00:03:22.669 --> 00:03:24.571 align:start size:94% position:6%
to take Dumpy out
to the bathroom,

00:03:24.571 --> 00:03:26.873 align:start size:94% position:6%
there was paparazzi.
And I'm thinking, "Oh, my God.

00:03:26.873 --> 00:03:28.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
oh, they just
won't leave me alone."

00:03:28.775 --> 00:03:31.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, an article that came out
a few days later,

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:33.012 align:start size:94% position:6%
that my girlfriend sent me
and it said,

00:03:33.012 --> 00:03:36.382
"Dump Truck goes to the bathroom
with blonde owner."

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:39.953 align:start size:94% position:6%
Had nothing to do with me.
[ Laughs ]

00:03:39.953 --> 00:03:44.557
They were there to see the Dumpy
in the stroller.

00:03:44.557 --> 00:03:46.492
-You know that means you have to
get a T-shirt

00:03:46.492 --> 00:03:50.396
that says "Blonde Owner," right?
-"Blonde Owner." [ Laughs

00:03:50.396 --> 00:03:52.999
-You gotta do it.
You gotta make it easy for them.

00:03:52.999 --> 00:03:55.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, no one cared it was me.
They followed --

00:03:55.768 --> 00:03:57.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
They were following us
all over New York.

00:03:57.470 --> 00:03:58.571 line:92%
And I realized they were tryin

00:03:58.571 --> 00:04:00.473
to get all of the photos
of Dumpy in the stroller.

00:04:00.473 --> 00:04:03.876 align:start size:94% position:6%
He became an overnight success
-Hopefully --

00:04:03.876 --> 00:04:08.014 align:start size:94% position:6%
Please do not allow your
personal jealousy towards that

00:04:08.014 --> 00:04:10.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
to drive a wedge
between you and Dumpy.

00:04:10.316 --> 00:04:13.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm begging that of you.
-I was pretty pissed.

00:04:13.653 --> 00:04:16.389 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let me tell you.
The narcissist inside me

00:04:16.389 --> 00:04:17.724 align:start size:94% position:6%
thought everyone
wanted to see me,

00:04:17.724 --> 00:04:20.393 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I was sorely mistaken.
[ Chuckles ]

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:22.428 line:92%
-So, congrats on the show.

00:04:22.428 --> 00:04:25.298 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's weird to say
this show is fun,

00:04:25.298 --> 00:04:29.269
because -- spoiler alert -
some very dark things happen

00:04:29.269 --> 00:04:32.805 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, tonally, it is --
I don't know.

00:04:32.805 --> 00:04:36.542
There's a nice energy to it.
I assume getting the tone righ

00:04:36.542 --> 00:04:39.946
was a massive part of the show
that you're also a producer on

00:04:39.946 --> 00:04:43.716
-I gotta tell you, the amount of
conversations we had

00:04:43.716 --> 00:04:46.286 size:84% position:42%
about the word "tone"--
-[ Chuckling ] Yeah.

00:04:46.286 --> 00:04:48.054 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Over the last year,
it's pretty --

00:04:48.054 --> 00:04:50.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
I didn't think I could say
that word so many times

00:04:50.556 --> 00:04:53.159 size:88% position:44%
or hear other people say
that word so many times.

00:04:53.159 --> 00:04:55.962 align:start size:94% position:6%
I wish I had picked
a clearer tone of a projec

00:04:55.962 --> 00:05:00.533 align:start size:94% position:6%
for my first producing venture
but I picked a tricky one.

00:05:00.533 --> 00:05:02.035 line:92%
And, yes, it's definitely --

00:05:02.035 --> 00:05:05.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
it rides a wave
of adventure and sadness.

00:05:05.371 --> 00:05:07.006 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, obviously,
there's a brutal murder.

00:05:07.006 --> 00:05:10.610
But since I can't help but b
a little funny here and there,

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:12.345 align:start size:94% position:6%
it was definitely written
in my voice.

00:05:12.345 --> 00:05:14.380 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, based on
the episode I've seen,

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:15.815 align:start size:94% position:6%
you thread the needle
very nicely.

00:05:15.815 --> 00:05:19.886
And you also had to work around,
like a lot of productions,

00:05:19.886 --> 00:05:21.888 align:start size:94% position:6%
the pandemic
we're living through.

00:05:21.888 --> 00:05:24.724 size:75% position:38%
You, sort of, got in
just under the wire,

00:05:24.724 --> 00:05:26.392 align:start size:94% position:6%
because you were shooting
in Italy, right?

00:05:26.392 --> 00:05:30.997
-We were shooting in Italy, yes.
We shot in Thailand and Italy.

00:05:30.997 --> 00:05:34.033 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then, in Italy, was
in end of January,

00:05:34.033 --> 00:05:37.804 align:start size:94% position:6%
right before
things started shutting down

00:05:37.804 --> 00:05:41.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, and then, also, we had
all these months off,

00:05:41.774 --> 00:05:43.609 align:start size:94% position:6%
like everybody else.
And then we just went back

00:05:43.609 --> 00:05:45.478 align:start size:94% position:6%
and finished,
which was also hilarious,

00:05:45.478 --> 00:05:48.047 align:start size:94% position:6%
because the show takes place
in winter in New York.

00:05:48.047 --> 00:05:50.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we went back, and
it was beautiful and summer.

00:05:50.416 --> 00:05:53.119 align:start size:94% position:6%
And everyone in the background
was wearing masks.

00:05:53.119 --> 00:05:55.388 line:92%
So it was a very strange trip.

00:05:55.388 --> 00:05:57.390 align:start size:94% position:6%
When we looked at dailies, w
were like, "Oh, my God.

00:05:57.390 --> 00:06:00.360
That guy's got a mask on."
And we're trying to, like, shift

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.562 line:92%
how we were doing everything

00:06:02.562 --> 00:06:04.931 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And you have -- I think
a lot of productions

00:06:04.931 --> 00:06:07.300 align:start size:94% position:6%
have rules now about the numbe
of extras you can have.

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:11.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you have to double up
and use people more than once.

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:13.239 align:start size:94% position:6%
That must make things tricky
as well.

00:06:13.239 --> 00:06:16.542
-We... [ Laughs ] So, yes.
So, we obviously were trying

00:06:16.542 --> 00:06:18.778 align:start size:94% position:6%
to minimize any new people
in and out of our set.

00:06:18.778 --> 00:06:22.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
So we had six extras
that we used for 2 1/2 months.

00:06:22.849 --> 00:06:24.517 size:88% position:44% line:92%
And we kept putting them

00:06:24.517 --> 00:06:26.786 align:start size:94% position:6%
in different wigs,
different outfits,

00:06:26.786 --> 00:06:29.021 align:start size:94% position:6%
kind of mixing
and matching them.

00:06:29.021 --> 00:06:29.655 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
On the plane, too,

00:06:29.655 --> 00:06:30.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
because we had to have the
enter the plane.

00:06:30.823 --> 00:06:32.792 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, "These people ar
gonna look like they take

00:06:32.792 --> 00:06:35.695 align:start size:94% position:6%
a lot of flights,
if anyone notices."

00:06:35.695 --> 00:06:37.296 align:start size:94% position:6%
But it was the only way
we could do it.

00:06:37.296 --> 00:06:41.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
So we -- we did our best.
-You should do another show,

00:06:41.434 --> 00:06:43.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
just about these
six weird people

00:06:43.136 --> 00:06:44.203 align:start size:94% position:6%
that are constantly going
back and forth

00:06:44.203 --> 00:06:46.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
from New York to Thailand.
-[ Laughing ] Yeah.

00:06:46.706 --> 00:06:50.276 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It would be funny.
-It's looking very creepy.

00:06:50.276 --> 00:06:52.078 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's very strange.
But I could --

00:06:52.078 --> 00:06:53.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
When I would watch dailies
I'm like, "Oh, my God.

00:06:53.613 --> 00:06:55.481
You guys, we had those two
people talk to each other

00:06:55.481 --> 00:06:58.217 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the last scene.
We gotta move them around.

00:06:58.217 --> 00:07:00.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
Well, it all worked out.

00:07:00.753 --> 00:07:03.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
And now, we have, coming up,
Thanksgiving,

00:07:03.823 --> 00:07:05.825 align:start size:94% position:6%
which I think is going to be
obviously, tricky

00:07:05.825 --> 00:07:07.193 align:start size:94% position:6%
and different for everybod
this year.

00:07:07.193 --> 00:07:08.661 align:start size:94% position:6%
You also have a birthday
coming up.

00:07:08.661 --> 00:07:10.096 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you have any plans?
Are you gonna --

00:07:10.096 --> 00:07:11.664 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is it just gonna be
you and Dumpy

00:07:11.664 --> 00:07:13.332 align:start size:94% position:6%
scrolling through "Daily Mail"
to see if

00:07:13.332 --> 00:07:15.701 align:start size:94% position:6%
your pictures are in there
-I'm having a party

00:07:15.701 --> 00:07:18.037 align:start size:94% position:6%
for like 200 people
on my birthday.

00:07:18.037 --> 00:07:20.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, God.
-I'm really excited about it

00:07:20.573 --> 00:07:24.710 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hopefully, just 200 peopl
who know a lot of --

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:27.480 align:start size:94% position:6%
have a lot of elderly friends.
I think that's best.

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:29.615 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, exactly.
That's what I was thinking

00:07:29.615 --> 00:07:31.117 line:92%
Yeah, for sure. for sure.

00:07:31.117 --> 00:07:34.854 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, thank you so much
for being here.

00:07:34.854 --> 00:07:37.290 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you for all your tim
in quarantine.

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:40.793 align:start size:94% position:6%
We do appreciate
everybody taking it seriously.

00:07:40.793 --> 00:07:41.594 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Love to Dumpy.

00:07:41.594 --> 00:07:44.330 align:start size:94% position:6%
We are hoping
you can help us book him.

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:46.065 size:88% position:44% line:92%
And all the best, Kaley.

00:07:46.065 --> 00:07:48.100 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I didn't want that to happen.
Thank you.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:49.869 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Both laugh ]
-Be well.

00:07:49.869 --> 00:07:51.604
The first three episodes of "The
Flight Attendant"

00:07:51.604 --> 00:07:54.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
will be available on HBO Max
on Thanksgiving Day.

00:07:54.707 --> 00:07:56.843 line:92%
A great way to spend some time

